<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-aragonite-110-cyclic-twin-suppression-of-2-fold-terrace-elongation-f-2-measured-on-anisotropic-eikonal-terrace-ring> a schema:PropertyValue,
