<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-cartwright-nacre-spiral-dislocation-terraces-measurement-columnar-to-sheet-stacking-transition-bridge-localisation-sigma-d-tab-at-which-the-mean-offset-first-exceeds-0-1-d-tab> a schema:PropertyValue,
